        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 2
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 604768166}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: 'Magandang araw, Bayani, narating mo na ang dulo ng ating mahabang
            paglalakbay. Sa huling bahagi ng nobela, hindi na tagpo ng aksyon ang
            nangingibabaw, kundi ang bigat ng katotohanan: may mga pag-ibig na hindi
            nagtagumpay, may mga pangarap na naglaho, at may mga bayani na nalimot
            ng panahon. Ngunit sa bawat sugat at sakripisyo ay may aral na naiwan.'
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins: []
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 604768166}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Good day, class!
        - characterObj: {fileID: 604768166}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: "Today, we are going to talk about a very interesting and important
            topic \u2014 the thematic analysis of Chapters 1 to 5 of Noli Me Tangere.
            This lesson is important because it helps us understand not only the
            story, but also the social issues and historical realities that Rizal
            wanted to expose during his time"
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1061087986}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 58396323}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1456372864}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1456372864}
          direction: 2
          walk: 0
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 1
      interval: 1
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 604768166}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Sa ikasampong antas ng ating paglalakbay sa Noli Me Tangere, Ang
            epilogo ng Noli ay isang paalala na ang pagbabago ay hindi laging nakikita
            sa tagumpay, kundi sa mga buhay na nagbukas ng daan para sa kinabukasan.
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1061087986}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 58396323}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1456372864}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 604768166}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4146786208365501868, guid: c93d112543efd3442b3f6e56f9c6443c, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Sa katahimikan ng Bisperas ng Pasko, natagpuan ang bangkay ni Elias
            sa tabi ng libingan ng kanyang lolo. Wala siyang maringal na lamay, walang
            papuri, ngunit ang kanyang sakripisyo ay naging binhi ng pag-asa para
            sa bayan.
        - characterObj: {fileID: 604768166}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1335385452945238478, guid: 07e51229e838fae46a5bcaeaa93cef86, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Sa loob ng makakapal na pader, nakatingin si Maria Clara sa malayo,
            bitbit ang kalayaang ipinagkait sa kanya. Ang kanyang pagiging madre
            ay hindi bunga ng pananampalataya, kundi ng takot at pang-aabuso ng kapangyarihan.
        - characterObj: {fileID: 604768166}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4633355498211079068, guid: beedf3f061a74ad4ea40126dc93eec99, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Si Capitan Tiago ay unti-unting nalugmok, nawalan ng sigla, at dinapuan
            ng masamang bisyo. Ang pagkawala ni Maria Clara ay naghubad sa kanya
            ng lahat ng yaman na totoo.
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1061087986}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 58396323}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1456372864}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 604768166}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: This is the end of our discussion
        - characterObj: {fileID: 604768166}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: "Now you must search for 10 hidden scrolls. Each scroll contains
            trivia. Collect them all, and you will unlock the quiz to prove what
            you\u2019ve learned"
      setLocation:
